{"channelId":"UCRFIPG2u1DxKLNuE3y2SjHA","row":["SciShow Kids",1700000,"From the team behind the YouTube series SciShow comes SciShow Kids!\n\nJoin host Jessi, her robot rat friend Squeaks, and all their friends at the Fort as they explain fun, complex science concepts for young, curious minds. Whether conducting experiments, researching new questions, or talking with experts, there’s always something new to discover with SciShow Kids, no matter what your age!\n\nSciShow Kids is streaming on Peacock and Roku! Just search for SciShow Kids to watch a special selection of our favorite compilations. New episodes of SciShow Kids will continue to be posted on YouTube.\n\nSciShow Kids is ideal for early-elementary learners, Grades 1-3, and most episodes are structured around the Next Generation Science Standards (NGSS) curriculum.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRFIPG2u1DxKLNuE3y2SjHA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRFIPG2u1DxKLNuE3y2SjHA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:47.871Z","channelId":"UCRFIPG2u1DxKLNuE3y2SjHA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"311ade22f7b9582e34eaa13c6b833ddf13e22867bc615e1d5f0a932cc39019e8","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"00829e6335dc57d563faee69f56ed063f17d1c330895135222275c37862cb4a7"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRFIPG2u1DxKLNuE3y2SjHA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:47.871Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRFIPG2u1DxKLNuE3y2SjHA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1700000,"raw":"1.7M subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRFIPG2u1DxKLNuE3y2SjHA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:47.871Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"